 "lede": "A new agent is inspected before it joins: identity, access and workspace. While the team works, every start, failure and recovery is announced in the team chat. When one agent says another never answered, the agent follows that message hop by hop and names where it stopped. If a role misbehaves, every agent in that role is stopped at once, and the record shows what each one did.",
